格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"ANOLISA (Agentic Nexus Operating Layer & Interface System Architecture) | Agentic OS with runtime, security, observability, and Tokenless response compression for lower token usage and cost.","id":"gh:1195873793","install_available":false,"language":"Rust","name":"ANOLISA","slug":"agentic-os-org/ANOLISA","topics":["agent-infrastructure","agent-memory","agent-runtime","agent-security","agentic-ai","agentic-os","ai-agents","context-engineering","developer-tools","dsh-plugin","linux","observability","runtime-security","rust","sandbox","skill","token-optimization"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"ANOLISA (Agentic Nexus Operating Layer & Interface System Architecture) | Agentic OS with runtime, s"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ecurity, observability, and Tokenless response compression for lower token usage and cost."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"**A**gentic **N**exus **O**perating **L**ayer & **I**nterface **S**ystem **A**rchitecture"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**A system software stack for AI Agents.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"中文版 · Website ·\nGet Started · User Guide ·\nContribute"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"**ANOLISA is a multi-component system software stack for AI Agent workloads.**\nBuilt on existing ope"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"rating system kernels and infrastructure, it provides\ncontext management, Skills delivery, workspace"},{"id":"p5s3","text":" recovery, security, and\nobservability for Agent applications, frameworks and platforms.\n**Users** c"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"an carry out tasks in a native terminal that preserves a familiar\nShell experience, and enable syste"},{"id":"p5s5","text":"m-level optimizations for their Agents'\nruntime environments. **Developers** can extend the stack th"},{"id":"p5s6","text":"rough\nAW's open architecture\nby integrating their own system software optimized for Agent workloads "},{"id":"p5s7","text":"en architecture\nby integrating their own system software optimized for Agent workloads into ANOLISA."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"> **ANOLISA vs. Agentic OS:** Agentic OS describes a class of operating systems\n> designed for AI Ag"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"ent workloads. Our community takes a neutral and open\n> approach to exploring this direction; ANOLIS"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"A is the core system software\n> stack in the Agentic OS architecture we design."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## 1. Get started"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"ANOLISA offers three ways to get started: use a **preinstalled image** to\nexperience the full capabi"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"lities of an Agentic OS; install the system software\nstack on an existing OS to **extend it into an "},{"id":"p8s3","text":"Agentic OS**; or connect an\nexisting Agent application, framework, or harness to\n**enable configurab"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"le system-level optimizations**."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"### 1.1 Start from an image"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"In a ready-to-use preinstalled system environment, you can use familiar Shell\nworkflows in cosh and "},{"id":"p10s2","text":"call system tools and Skills through natural language.\nAfter installing and configuring the relevant"},{"id":"p10s3","text":" components, you can also use\nAgent Semantic Layer capabilities such as context compression, workspa"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"ce\nsnapshots and recovery, security, and observability. Container base images\nprovide a starting poi"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"nt for building your own Agent runtime environment."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"The Images and cloud services\ncatalog lists available images, their preinstalled software, download "},{"id":"p11s2","text":"or pull\naddresses, and cloud service entry points. Vendors and community contributors\ncan add image "},{"id":"p11s3","text":"or cloud service entries and usage instructions to the catalog."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Developers of Agent platforms and Agent runtime infrastructure can preinstall\nANOLISA packages in Ag"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"ent, sandbox, or business images. See the\nbase image catalog\nand package installation guide."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### 1.2 Convert an existing OS into an Agentic OS"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"If you already run a supported Linux system, you can install ANOLISA's system\nsoftware stack to add "},{"id":"p14s2","text":"runtime capabilities for Agent workloads. You can install\ncosh, OS Skills, and the Agent Semantic La"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"yer components you need, use cosh as\nthe terminal entry point, and configure model access and the re"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"ou need, use cosh as\nthe terminal entry point, and configure model access and the relevant services."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"First read the installation guide\nto check platform requirements, then install the packages and conf"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"igure the\nservices. Follow the cosh first-use guide\nto begin using the terminal."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"### 1.3 Enable ANOLISA for an existing Agent"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"If you want to keep using an existing Agent application, framework, or harness,\nyou can enable ANOLI"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"SA's headless system capabilities in its runtime environment\nthrough adapters and plugins. You can c"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"ontinue using the Agent's interface,\nmodel account, and workflow."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"For the currently available workflow, see installation and adapter integration."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## 2. Why ANOLISA?"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"**ANOLISA is a system software stack that enhances Agent applications,\nframeworks, and harnesses wit"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"hout replacing them.**"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"When Agents plan tasks and call tools, they also need their runtime environments\nto provide context "},{"id":"p21s2","text":"management, Skill discovery, action constraints, and execution\nrecords. ANOLISA improves an Agent's "},{"id":"p21s3","text":"working environment in the following ways:"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"- **Keep context for useful information.** Tool output compression shortens\nlengthy results. Persist"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"ent memory lets Agents retrieve and reuse information\nacross sessions, reducing repeated reads.\n- **"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"Find system Skills for the task.** Agents can consult OS instructions and\ndiscover and read the Skil"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"ls they need for a task.\n- **Constrain actions and recover workspace changes.** Security policies an"},{"id":"p22s5","text":"d\nunderlying isolation mechanisms constrain Agent actions. Workspace snapshots\nlet users inspect fil"},{"id":"p22s6","text":"e changes and roll them back when needed.\n- **Understand how a task ran.** You can inspect an Agent'"},{"id":"p22s7","text":"s model and tool calls,\ntrajectories, and Token usage to investigate task failures and analyze runti"},{"id":"p22s8","text":"nd tool calls,\ntrajectories, and Token usage to investigate task failures and analyze runtime\ncosts."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"We welcome **OS vendors and distribution communities** to adopt and help develop\nANOLISA, integratin"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"g it into existing distributions or incorporating it into\ntheir Agentic OS architecture from the out"},{"id":"p23s3","text":" into existing distributions or incorporating it into\ntheir Agentic OS architecture from the outset."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"**Enterprise Agent governance platform developers** and **sandbox service providers**\ncan also prein"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"stall ANOLISA in their runtime environments to provide context\nmanagement, security, and observabili"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"ty for the Agent workloads they host."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## 5. Open architecture"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Within ANOLISA's AW Unified Stack Layer, AW connects Agents to the system\nsoftware that supports the"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"m. Developers can build adapters for Agents that AW\ndoes not yet support, or create system software "},{"id":"p26s3","text":"optimized for Agent workloads\nand expose its capabilities to ANOLISA through the Provider protocol. "},{"id":"p26s4","text":"The\nexisting Agent application or framework continues to manage its models,\ninterface, and permissio"},{"id":"p26s5","text":"\nexisting Agent application or framework continues to manage its models,\ninterface, and permissions."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"AW currently integrates command safety checks and tool-content optimization,\nand can correlate Agent"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"Sight execution records through optional configuration.\nThe existing operating system, kernel, and s"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"andbox provide the underlying\nresources and isolation mechanisms. ANOLISA is designed for environmen"},{"id":"p27s4","text":"ts\nincluding AI PCs and cloud desktops, Agent applications and frameworks, Agent\nplatforms, and Agen"},{"id":"p27s5","text":"t runtime infrastructure."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
